{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Dinosaur Shakespeare 3: They Are On The Moon Now And It Escalated Quickly - Bloodcore Edition",
    "steam_appid": 3827390,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827390/extras/a65a3ce76ce54f0742a5ea5a2fc4ed9e.avif?t=1755243187\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Based on the actual scientific phenomena of impacta ejecta comes a tale based entirely in imagination.</strong>\u00a0What if the dinosaurs that were yeeted out into space..... survived? What if they made it to The Moon(tm)?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game asks and answers these important questions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Theropod Empire devours all. Good thing &quot;all&quot; for right now is the dark side of the moon. There's still time to fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legendary Smuggler Hornstar cares not for rebellions. Princess Zauren lives for them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Hornstar, you must do the dirty work. As Zauren, you must navigate political minefields.\u00a0Together, they must set aside their differences to unite the Moon Colonies and fight for Moon Freedom.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is science fiction. This is tragedy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is <strong>dino-powered post-apocalyptic theater.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827390/extras/d972272b1d6505cd48fb2928589453e2.avif?t=1755243187\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Genre: Visual Novel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wacky sci-fi satire:</strong>\u00a0step into the shoes of multiple dinosaur heroes in a game filled with choice-driven storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five+ story variables to manipulate for incredible branching outcomes that may or may not vary in incredibility</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five+ endings (synergy with the above featured bullet point! Cool!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reactive narrative:</strong> Declare mortal enemies. Form lunar alliances. Accidentally explode the wrong moon base</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe get some dinosaurs to kiss</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827390/extras/a65a3ce76ce54f0742a5ea5a2fc4ed9e.avif?t=1755243187\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Based on the actual scientific phenomena of impacta ejecta comes a tale based entirely in imagination.</strong>\u00a0What if the dinosaurs that were yeeted out into space..... survived? What if they made it to The Moon(tm)?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game asks and answers these important questions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Theropod Empire devours all. Good thing &quot;all&quot; for right now is the dark side of the moon. There's still time to fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legendary Smuggler Hornstar cares not for rebellions. Princess Zauren lives for them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Hornstar, you must do the dirty work. As Zauren, you must navigate political minefields.\u00a0Together, they must set aside their differences to unite the Moon Colonies and fight for Moon Freedom.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is science fiction. This is tragedy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is <strong>dino-powered post-apocalyptic theater.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827390/extras/d972272b1d6505cd48fb2928589453e2.avif?t=1755243187\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Genre: Visual Novel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wacky sci-fi satire:</strong>\u00a0step into the shoes of multiple dinosaur heroes in a game filled with choice-driven storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five+ story variables to manipulate for incredible branching outcomes that may or may not vary in incredibility</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five+ endings (synergy with the above featured bullet point! Cool!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reactive narrative:</strong> Declare mortal enemies. Form lunar alliances. Accidentally explode the wrong moon base</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe get some dinosaurs to kiss</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "The Saurian Alliance is threatened by The Theropod Empire. That's scary. Our heroes, a ragtag group of dinosaurs from all walks of life (and one that is definitely not a Corgi-Iguanodon hybrid), must band together to fight back against the dark side of The Moon(tm).",
